<title>USA: Starcraft Corp to buy  National Mobility.</title>
<headline>Starcraft Corp to buy  National Mobility.</headline>
<dateline>GOSHEN, Ind. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Starcraft Corp said Wednesday it reached an agreement to acquire National Mobility Corp for an undisclosed price.</p>
<p>National Mobility makes conversion vehicles for the physically challenged, posting annual sales of more than $5 million, Starcraft said.</p>
<p>Starcraft manufatures second-stage van, truck and sport utility conversions through three divisions.</p>
<p>Its shares were up 1/8 Wednesday afternoon at 4-5/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
